# Keep the npm tarball lean. The example pages render complete CSS-only
# placeholders when their image assets are absent (probe() fallback), so the
# heavy stills don't need to ship in the convenience installer. Full-fidelity
# imagery lives in the git repo (clone) and the Claude Code plugin install.
**/assets/

# Never ship dependencies or the marketing landing page.
**/node_modules/
node_modules/
index.html

# Channel-specific / dev cruft not needed by the npm installer.
.claude-plugin/
.env.local
*.log
